%N A023518 Greatest exponent in prime-power factorization of prime(n)*prime(n-1) - 1; a(1) = 0.
%H A023518 Amiram Eldar, <a href="/A023518/b023518.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..10000</a> (terms 1..1000 from Harvey P. Dale)
%F A023518 a(n) = A051903(A023515(n)). - _Amiram Eldar_, Sep 22 2026
%t A023518 Join[{0},Max[Transpose[FactorInteger[#]][[2]]]&/@(Times@@@Partition[ Prime[ Range[80]],2,1]-1)] (* _Harvey P. Dale_, Jun 19 2013 *)
%o A023518 (PARI) a(n) = if(n == 1, 0, vecmax(factor(prime(n-1)*prime(n)-1)[,2])); \\ _Amiram Eldar_, Sep 22 2026
%Y A023518 Cf. A023515, A051903.
